  {
   "id": "K01",
   "check": "correlation",
   "asset": "CX",
   "tracker": "CY",
   "expected": 0.5,
   "derivation": "Monthly returns: X +1%, +2%, +3%; Y +1%, +3%, +2%. Deviations from the mean (2%): X -1, 0, +1; Y -1, +1, 0 (in %). Sum of products = 1. Sums of squares = 2 and 2. Correlation = 1 / sqrt(2 x 2) = 0.5."
  },
  {
