    "highest_end": "2020-04"
   },
   "derivation": "Returns X +1, +2, +3, +2, +1%; Y +1, +3, +2, +2, +3% (Feb to Jun). Five returns, window 3: 5 - 3 + 1 = 3 runs. Run ending Apr: 0.5 (as K01). Run ending May: X 2,3,2 vs Y 3,2,2: sum of products -1/3, sums of squares 2/3 and 2/3, so -0.5. Run ending Jun: X 3,2,1 vs Y 2,2,3: sum of products -1, sums of squares 2 and 2/3, so -1 / sqrt(4/3) = -sqrt(3)/2 = -0.866."
  },
